It's his song, Rubber Tree, with Mr. Ed Helms on banjo.
这是他的歌《Rubber Tree》，由埃德·赫尔姆斯先生演奏班卓琴。

1340
00:55:01.480 --> 00:55:13.170
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies' Second Drink.
感谢收听《办公室女士》的番外篇。

